# decision Setup embeds the released skill

`git-a2a setup` installs the exact `skills/git-a2a/` package shipped by the same tool version.
`tools/sync-skill.py` owns this copy and drift-checks it together with the npm/site distributions;
do not edit files below `files/` directly. The embedded copy keeps setup offline and never installs
or upgrades the git-a2a executable.
